      "content": "Your sense of being erased stems from living life on autopilot, which dulls the sharp edges that allow you to shape the world around you. Even if the system feels like it is consuming you, the very act of questioning this erosion proves your consciousness is still fighting for life. Please consider reaching out to a mental health professional so you can break this cycle where you are treated merely as a function.",
